  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Derry, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     Discover Derry   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Doing Business   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t 1. Dog License \r\n\t\t\t 2. Birth, Death, Divorce, & Marriage Certificates \r\n\t\t\t 3. Marriage License & Ceremonies \r\n\t\t\t 4. Election Information \r\n\t\t\t 5. Additional Information \r\n\t\t\t 6. Newsletter \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\n***** Town Clerk hours are changing as of July 6, 2026 to: ***** \nMonday, Tuesday, Thursday, and Friday 7 am - 4 pm. \nWednesday 7 am - 5 pm. \nMission \nThe Town Clerk's Office is responsible for the recording and management of all the Town's Vital Records, Meeting Minutes, Dog Licensing and conducting all local, state and national elections as well as voter registration and absentee ballot requests. \nTax Payments and Motor Vehicle Registration handled by  Tax Collector | Town of Derry NH \nTo ensure delivery of renewal notification, please add  [email protected]  to your safe sender list. \nAgendas and Minutes \nAgendas are available before the meetings. Minutes are available and approved. \nView Most Recent Agendas and Minutes \r\nContact Us \r\n\t\t\tCristina Guilford\r\nTown Clerk \r\nPhone:  \r\nMore Information \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Derry Municipal Center \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 14 Manning Street \n\t\t\t\t\t Derry ,  NH   03038 \r\nDerry Municipal Center 14 Manning Street Derry NH 03038 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\nPhone:  603-432-6105 \r\nFax: 603-432-8176 \r\nHours of Operation \nM, T, T & F 7 am - 4 pm \nW 7 am - 5 pm \r\n\t\t\t\t\tCristina Guilford\r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail Cristina Guilford \r\nNews Flash \r\n\t Stay connected!  \r\nSubscribe to Notify Me to receive updates and information about community news and happenings.\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Planning Office Closed  October 21-23, 2026  \r\nOctober 21 - 23, 2026\t\t\t\t Read on... \r\n\t Derry Public Works is Lowering Beaver Meadow Dam  \r\nFrom October 12, 2026, until November 25, 2026\t \r\n\t\t View All News \r\n/CivicAlerts.aspx \r\nCalendar \r\nMon, Oct. 19   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Conservation Commission \r\nTue, Oct. 20   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Town Council \r\nWed, Oct. 21   \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Planning Board - No Meeting \r\n\t\t         View All Events \r\n/Calendar.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas &  Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Payments \r\n\t\t\t Forms & Documents \r\n\t\t\t Contact Us \r\n\t\t\t Bids & RFPs \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\n\t\t\t Online Mapping Portal \r\n\t\t\t Exit 4A \r\n\t\t\t Permits \r\n\t\t\t Election Info \n\t\t\t Planning & Zoning Applications \n\t\t\t Derry CAM \nContact Us \r\nTown of Derry - Municipal Center \n14 Manning Street, Derry, N.H. 03038 \n(603) 432-6100 \nHours: Mon-Fri 7am-4pm \nTax Office and Town Clerk \nExtended Hours: Weds until 5pm. \r\nPopular Links \r\n         Town Code \n         CodeRED Sign Up \n         Explore Derry \n         Derry Homegrown Farm & Artisan Market \n         State & Federal Resources \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Notify Me! \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
